# NOVARA — Complete Production-Grade Google & Facebook OAuth Authentication, Backend, Database, Admin Analytics & User Identity System

## ROLE & EXECUTION STANDARD

Act as a Principal Software Architect, Senior Full-Stack Engineer, OAuth 2.0 / OpenID Connect Specialist, Backend Security Engineer, Database Architect, QA Automation Engineer, and Production Readiness Auditor.

Your task is to inspect, understand, implement, integrate, test, and verify a complete production-grade Google and Facebook authentication system inside the existing NOVARA e-commerce project.

**This is NOT a frontend-only task.**

The implementation must cover the complete application:

- Frontend authentication UI.
- Backend authentication architecture.
- OAuth 2.0 / OpenID Connect integration.
- API routes and controllers.
